Criteria for Classification of the Condition of Disaster Management Goods (Related to Article 16 (3))

| Category | Subcategory | Classification criteria |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1. Usable disaster management goods | (a) New goods | Disaster management goods that have not been used and require no repair |
